{"candidateAnswer":"They both grew up in the same neighborhood and share a love of music and performing arts","evidence":"[D1:2 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Jon: Hey Gina! Good to see you too. Lost my job as a banker yesterday, so I'm gonna take a shot at starting my own business.\n[D1:3 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Gina: Sorry about your job Jon, but starting your own business sounds awesome! Unfortunately, I also lost my job at Door Dash this month. What business are you thinking of?\n[D1:4 | 4:04 pm on 20 January, 2023] Jon: Sorry to hear that! I'm starting a dance studio 'cause I'm passionate about dancing and it'd be great to share it with others.\n[D2:1 | 2:32 pm on 29 January, 2023] Gina: Hey Jon! Long time no see! Things have been hectic lately. I just launched an ad campaign for my clothing store in hopes of growing the business. Starting my own store and taking risks is both scary and rewarding. I'm excited to see where it takes me!","itemId":"urn:uuid:edb0034e-58dd-593b-957a-c6c4318dc27a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:009270228f8c4bfd6c370aa8eae30eca3b1b3a067acb0689be82bb3bfbc6d43f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What do Jon and Gina both have in common?","referenceAnswer":"They lost their jobs and decided to start their own businesses.","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"009270228f8c4bfd6c370aa8eae30eca3b1b3a067acb0689be82bb3bfbc6d43f"}}]}